DEFINE DATA LOCAL
/* >Natural Source Header 000000
/* :Mode S
/* :CP
/* <Natural Source Header
*   RMSPL3-L - Spool attribute       definition
*   CONVERSION 3BYTE NODENUMBR TO N5
*
*   Maintenance
*   uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
