*   SU1     2024-03-07 ES-34613      NOM 3.6:  Remove power
*   ---------------------------------      -----------------------------------
*   Spool Attributes
*   ---------------------------------      -----------------------------------
1 #SPOOL-ATTR-3 (A250)
*   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*   SEQUENTIAL FILE BS2
*   --------------------------------------------------------------------
1 REDEFINE #SPOOL-ATTR-3
  2 #SPOOL3-TYPE (I2)
  2 #SPOOL3-ATTRIB (A248)
  2 REDEFINE #SPOOL3-ATTRIB
    3 #SPOOL3-BS2-NODE (N3)
